# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4-serve-4 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# D0: the audits-off reproduction with the repaired instruments (c2-packed-tp4-diag: both verify audits off, the old tail, the
# stall watch at 120 s with its triage sidecar, the repaired trace census with no graph capture, the CCL handle guard in log mode).
# Its job is to NAME the stuck work if the hang recurs (the stall watch's thread dump and triage), before any fix is credited.
# Duration (estimate): 20-30 min; a stall costs the deadline plus triage, then the next job's reset.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-4
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-diag
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4_v164order,concurrent4_steady,replay_concurrent4
